    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52313" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰκοπρᾱγ-ία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>misadventure, failure</i>,
