				Th.
				2.60
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐκ τῆς Σικελίας κ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				8.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. γίγνεται</span>”
